    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hottie Sweetie is a simulation management game for running a restaurant, using 3D graphics and accompanied by relaxing background music and beautiful maidservants to bring you a better restaurant management experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your restaurant</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait for the customer to come and take a seat to order, operate the machine to make the food the customer needs, and finally hand over the prepared food to the customer to complete the order.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand your restaurant</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase more tables and chairs, add more food making equipment, enrich restaurant orders, attract more customers, and earn more revenue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sweetie Maid</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maid ladies have a variety of clothing options to choose from. As orders are continuously completed, the Hottie will increase, and good things will happen when the Hottie level upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want add your language which not exist in this game, please contact email <a href=\"mailto:LAEStudioNEXT@outlook.com\">LAEStudioNEXT@outlook.com</a>, I will help you add your language to this game then update it.\u00a0</p>",
